        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "614542ff-48df-565c-b529-10b2b368b9b3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Wayne Knight, Doug TenNapel\n- Works: Jurassic Park, Space Jam, Toy Story 2, Tarzan, Bee Movie, Rat Race, Xiaolin Showdown, Catscratch, The Exes, Earthworm Jim\n- Roles: Dennis Nedry, Stan Podolak, Al McWhiggin, Tantor, the Giraffe, Zack Mallozzi, Dojo, Mr. Blik, Microchip, Haskell Lutz\n- Topics: American animated television series\n\nFacts:\n- Wayne Knight played Dennis Nedry in Jurassic Park.\n- Wayne Knight played Stan Podolak in Space Jam in 1996.\n- Wayne Knight voiced Al McWhiggin in Toy Story 2 in 1999.\n- Wayne Knight voiced Tantor in Tarzan in 1999.\n- Wayne Knight played Zack Mallozzi in Rat Race in 2001.\n- Wayne Knight voiced Dojo in Xiaolin Showdown from 2003 to 2006.\n- Catscratch is an American animated television series created by Doug TenNapel.\n- Wayne Knight voiced Mr. Blik in Catscratch from 2005 to 2007.\n- Wayne Knight voiced the Giraffe in Bee Movie in 2007.\n- Wayne Knight voiced Microchip in an unnamed 2008 work.\n- Wayne Knight played Haskell Lutz in The Exes from 2011 to 2015.\n- Doug TenNapel is also known for creating Earthworm Jim.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "92f335e0-a4ed-5c91-8bad-85181989e96a",
